# The corpus, the fit outputs and the logs stay out: selfplay_v2.tsv alone is
# 715 MB and every one of them is reproducible from a recorded command. The
# scripts do not -- anchors.py is the only executable record of how the pinned
# test values are derived, including the quiescence composite no evaluation
# model can produce. Children of an ignored directory cannot be re-included,
# hence the star.
.tuning/*
!.tuning/*.py
.reprofile

.claude/settings.local.json
